{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>מקור</b> — like a source of life, that whoever learns discipline from his mouth shall live; or, his mouth is the place that is known to him, from which comes life when he teaches his disciplines." "<b>יכסה חמס</b> — hides it, and does not learn discipline."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:51.043941396Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}